name wsd-data
# A data set of the framework: texts of sentences, each sentence the words it is made of. The file does not write a
# sentence as text: a sentence is the path of its words, in order. What is said of a word (its lemma, its pos) is said
# of the word, within its sentence. The ids (d000.s000.t000) are the framework's keys to its texts, sentences and
# instances, recorded nowhere; the gold keys and system answers that point at them by those ids are not read.
match *.data.xml
grammar xml
key id
words sentence wf instance
